が、何卒よろしくお願いします…！！！", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@nknk_fff/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2146707, "client_id": 1881650, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c0d302c/uploads/origins/196b950e-b5d3-4ffa-ac77-9083262410e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0de21ff649a2106ec5f4241f32d5fabf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3c0d302c/uploads/origins/196b950e-b5d3-4ffa-ac77-9083262410e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0de21ff649a2106ec5f4241f32d5fabf, https://si.imgix.net/3c0d302c/uploads/origins/196b950e-b5d3-4ffa-ac77-9083262410e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68c36917ab6cec75488c99a5923c0d9c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3c0d302c/uploads/origins/196b950e-b5d3-4ffa-ac77-9083262410e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63d12fcb49392a43ae8394b27386b7a1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3c0d302c/uploads/origins/196b950e-b5d3-4ffa-ac77-9083262410e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=04b2c0d3cf295e6834b8da9e7a475d85", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3c0d302c/uploads/origins/196b950e-b5d3-4ffa-ac77-9083262410e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=04b2c0d3cf295e6834b8da9e7a475d85, https://si.imgix.net/3c0d302c/uploads/origins/196b950e-b5d3-4ffa-ac77-9083262410e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d423807453e1122271d5ab57b1a4dfbc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3c0d302c/uploads/origins/196b950e-b5d3-4ffa-ac77-9083262410e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=335d1d1c3b31d1eadcd21f1800daa6d5 3x"}, "body": "Hi, I'm a member of the community and I'd like to thank you for your interest! My name is 💍 and I have already made a request once before!\nThe illustration you drew last time was so beautiful that I look at it every day and smile 🥰.\nI would like to send a request for a different character this time!\n\nThe character I would like you to draw is my surrogate character!\nI would appreciate it if you could refer to the following link for the character design.\nThe pose is up to you, and the expression should be a smile or a smiling face!\nAs for the costume, please use the classical one-piece costume (the one with the 3-sided view) in the document. (This one is designed by someone else, but we have permission.)\n\nWe would like to use it as an icon or header for social networking sites, or to make personal goods (such as ackee, acsta, etc.). (I will not sell or distribute any of the goods, but only own them myself.)\n\nAlso, if possible, I would like to receive separate portraits and backgrounds. (If this is too difficult, please do not send it to me.)\n\nI know you are busy, but thank you in advance...!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vxrvI0thsFhyhyiTumjqV0L9YKp1Gxru", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@nknk_fff/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2146707, "client_id": 1881650, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd4b60a2/uploads/origins/3ef5d609-080d-490b-8066-79c3121a16b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18de4a0c5e864604d45969defca7f196", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd4b60a2/uploads/origins/3ef5d609-080d-490b-8066-79c3121a16b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18de4a0c5e864604d45969defca7f196, https://si.imgix.net/fd4b60a2/uploads/origins/3ef5d60